---
// Resolution 05 / Pricing & Straight Talk Component
---
<section class="v6-section bg-dark">
  <div class="sec-container">
    <div class="sec-header text-center">
      <span class="sec-num cyan">RESOLUTION · 05</span>
      <h2 class="text-white">Begin resolution.</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub light">One-time purchase. No subscription. 14-day money-back guarantee.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pricing-split">
      <div class="pricing-card-main">
        <div class="p-card-header">
          <span class="p-edition">TOTALRECALLS — WINDOWS EDITION</span>
          <div class="price-display">
            <span class="price-val">$24</span>
            <span class="price-tag">LAUNCH PRICE</span>
          </div>
          <p class="p-desc">Get instant access to v1.3.0. Secure checkout via Lemon Squeezy with instant ZIP download link.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-card-actions">
          <a href="/pricing/" class="buy-button buy-lg btn-full" data-tr-buy>Buy TotalRecalls — $24</a>
          <a href="/download/" class="buy-secondary buy-lg btn-full" data-tr-download>Already purchased? Download ZIP</a>
        </div>

        <div class="p-card-guarantee">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 8v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
          <span>14-day money-back guarantee. If TotalRecalls doesn't work for your setup, email us for a full refund.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="straight-talk-box">
        <h3>Straight Talk &amp; Technical Notes</h3>
        <ul class="talk-list">
          <li>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>Platform:</strong> Windows 10/11 only (built on Python + WebView2). Mac version on roadmap if demand is real.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>Gemini Support:</strong> Uses Google Takeout JSON archives (the most reliable and complete export method).</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>SmartScreen Notice:</strong> Unsigned builds may trigger Windows SmartScreen ("More info → Run anyway") until code-signing reputation is established.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>Privacy Guarantee:</strong> Zero telemetry, zero cloud retention. Your API tokens and chat archives stay entirely on your local drive.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="solo-dev-note">
          <p><em>"Built by a solo developer who was tired of losing months of AI conversations to closed-source cloud silos."</em></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .v6-section {
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-4);
  }
  .bg-dark { background: #0F172A; color: #FFFFFF; }
  .text-center { text-align: center; }
  .text-white { color: #FFFFFF; }
  .cyan { color: #38BDF8 !important; }
  .sec-sub.light { color: #94A3B8; }
  
  .pricing-split {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: var(--space-8) auto 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .pricing-card-main {
    background: #1E293B;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }
  .p-edition {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #38BDF8;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .price-display {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .price-val {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .price-tag {
    background: #2F7BFF;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .p-desc {
    color: #94A3B8;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }
  .p-card-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }
  .btn-full {
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .p-card-guarantee {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #94A3B8;
    border-top: 1px solid #334155;
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
  }
  .p-card-guarantee svg {
    color: #10B981;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .straight-talk-box {
    background: #1E293B;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .straight-talk-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6) 0;
  }
  .talk-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6) 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }
  .talk-list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #CBD5E1;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .talk-list svg {
    color: #38BDF8;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  .solo-dev-note {
    border-top: 1px solid #334155;
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #94A3B8;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pricing-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
